# Carbon Guard has one settings file per component. Copy each example and fill it in locally:
#
#   backend\.env.example          -> backend\.env          (database, JWT secret, admin account, satellite...)
#   admin_dashboard\.env.example  -> admin_dashboard\.env  (VITE_API_URL: the backend address)
#   mobile_app                    -> no file; pass the backend address with
#                                    flutter run --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://<ip>:8000
#
# Never commit a real .env file. See SETUP_GUIDE.md.
